flowchart TD
    call[Guest calls a mutating CRDT API] --> preflight{Preflight}
    preflight -->|Reserved key or sync disabled| rejected[Definitely not accepted]
    preflight -->|Rga insert output buffer too small| grow[SDK grows buffer and retries safely]
    grow --> preflight
    preflight -->|Other error reported as ERR_INTERNAL| uncertain[Outcome unknown to caller]
    preflight -->|Pass| batch[Atomic state, OpId, seen ID, and replay batch]
    batch -->|Batch error reported as ERR_INTERNAL| uncertain
    batch --> flush{Confirmed flush}
    flush -->|Failure or interruption| uncertain
    flush -->|Completed| accepted[Durable state and replay record]
    accepted -->|Process stops before enqueue| uncertain
    accepted --> enqueue[Publish locally and enqueue for broadcast]
    enqueue --> response{Guest receives response}
    response -->|Success| durable[Durable locally under the process-crash model]
    response -->|Trap, interruption, or lost response| uncertain
    uncertain --> noRetry[Do not automatically retry the mutation]
    noRetry --> reopen[Reopen intact store to recover surviving operations]
    durable --> remote[Remote replication remains unconfirmed]
